  "title": "Don't worry",
  "goal": "Say what not to do, and understand polite and formal instructions.",
  "points": ["gp-imperative"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "The negative adds `-mA`: *Gelme!* (Don't come!) *Korkma!* (Don't be afraid!) To several people, or politely, a buffer y comes in: *Gelmeyin*, *Merak etmeyin* (Don't worry). Signs and forms use `-(y)InIz`: *Lütfen bekleyiniz* (Please wait).",
    "see": "gp-imperative"
  },
